+   * derived from what it overlaps, which is why `nodes()` is a method and not
+   * a stored list.
+   */
+  groups(): readonly GroupHandle[]
+  /**
+   * Scales the view. 1 is unzoomed.
+   *
+   * Packs saved a zoom level alongside a node to restore a view; without this
